    <desc>See and change the keyboard shortcuts of <app>Pano Terminal</app>.</desc>
  </info>

  <title>Keyboard shortcuts</title>

<p>Keyboard shortcuts are combinations of keys that you can use instead of
  menus. Most of the shortcuts of <app>Pano Terminal</app> use
  <keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key></keyseq>, so that programs in the terminal still get the
  usual <keyseq><key>Ctrl</key></keyseq> combinations.</p>

  <section id="change">
    <title>Change the shortcuts</title>
    <steps>
<item><p>Press the menu button in the top-right corner of the window and select <gui style="menuitem">Preferences</gui>.</p></item>
<item><p>In the <gui>Keyboard Shortcuts</gui> group, click <gui>View and Customize Shortcuts</gui>.</p></item>
<item><p>Click the action you want to change and press the new keys. Press <key>Backspace</key> to disable the shortcut, or <key>Esc</key> to keep it.</p></item>
</steps>
    <p>Many actions have no shortcut by default, for example
    <gui>Close Other Tabs</gui>, <gui>Broadcast Input to This Tab</gui>, the
    swapping of panes and <gui>Set Title</gui>; you can give them one there.
    Turn off <gui>Enable Shortcuts</gui> at the top to turn off all shortcuts
    of <app>Pano Terminal</app>.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="defaults">
    <title>Default shortcuts</title>
    <p>These are the shortcuts that <app>Pano Terminal</app> has by default.</p>

  <table rules="rows" frame="top bottom" ui:expanded="true">
    <title>File</title>
    <tr><td><p>New Tab</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>T</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>New Window</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>N</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Close Tab</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>W</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Reopen Closed Tab</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Alt</key><key>T</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Close Window</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Q</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
  </table>

  <table rules="rows" frame="top bottom" ui:expanded="true">
    <title>Edit</title>
    <tr><td><p>Copy</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>C</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Paste</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>V</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
  </table>

  <table rules="rows" frame="top bottom" ui:expanded="true">
    <title>Find</title>
    <tr><td><p>Find</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>F</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Find Next</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>G</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Find Previous</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>H</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Clear Highlight</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>J</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
  </table>

  <table rules="rows" frame="top bottom" ui:expanded="true">
    <title>View</title>
    <tr><td><p>Full Screen</p></td><td><p><key>F11</key></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Zoom In</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>+</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Zoom Out</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>-</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Normal Size</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>0</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Command Palette</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>P</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Quick Select</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Space</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
  </table>

  <table rules="rows" frame="top bottom" ui:expanded="true">
    <title>Terminal</title>
    <tr><td><p>Scroll to Previous Prompt</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Up</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Scroll to Next Prompt</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Down</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Copy Output of Last Command</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>O</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
  </table>

  <table rules="rows" frame="top bottom" ui:expanded="true">
    <title>Tabs</title>
    <tr><td><p>Switch to Previous Tab</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>Page Up</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Switch to Next Tab</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>Page Down</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Move Tab to the Left</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Page Up</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Move Tab to the Right</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Page Down</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Switch to Tab 1 to 10</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Alt</key><key>1</key></keyseq> to <keyseq><key>Alt</key><key>0</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Focus the Tab List</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>L</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
  </table>

  <table rules="rows" frame="top bottom" ui:expanded="true">
    <title>Panes</title>
    <tr><td><p>Split Right</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>R</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Split Down</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>D</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Close Pane</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>X</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Zoom Pane</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Z</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Focus the Pane on the Left, Right, Above or Below</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Alt</key><key>Arrow keys</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    <tr><td><p>Move Divider Left, Right, Up or Down</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Alt</key><key>Shift</key><key>Arrow keys</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
  </table>

    <p>The pane shortcuts take effect only while a tab is
    <link xref="gs-split-panes">split</link>, and the prompt shortcuts only
    with <link xref="cmd-shell-integration">shell integration</link>;
    otherwise the keys go to the program in the terminal.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="vte">
    <title>Shortcuts of the terminal itself</title>
    <table rules="rows" frame="top bottom" ui:expanded="true">
      <tr><td><p>Scroll up or down by one line</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Up</key></keyseq> / <keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>Down</key></keyseq> (without shell integration)</p></td></tr>
      <tr><td><p>Scroll up or down by one page</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Page Up</key></keyseq> / <keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Page Down</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
      <tr><td><p>Scroll to the top or bottom</p></td><td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Home</key></keyseq> / <keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>End</key></keyseq></p></td></tr>
    </table>
  </section>

